{
  "description": "Which names an @mention in a comment body names, in order. The web app's commentText rule and the server's NotificationRules read the same: paragraphs left to right, `code` and a link's label skipped, bold and italic read inside, and an @ at the start or after a space or an opening bracket, then a letter or digit, then letters, digits, dots, dashes and underscores, not ending in a mark (audit D3).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "body": "Which color, @ben-m? Ask @lee-m too",
      "names": ["ben-m", "lee-m"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Thanks @sam.",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "(@jo) and @kim_r, then @al.b!",
      "names": ["jo", "kim_r", "al.b"]
    },
    {
      "body": "@sam's turn",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "First line\n@sam on the next",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "@názov and @émile",
      "names": ["názov", "émile"]
    },
    {
      "body": "@123 counts",
      "names": ["123"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Mail ben@example.com",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "x@sam and @@sam",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "@-sam and @_sam and @ alone",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "@a",
      "names": ["a"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Ask `@sam` about it, @kim",
      "names": ["kim"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Run `ping @sam` now, @kim",
      "names": ["kim"]
    },
    {
      "body": "`(@sam) and @lee`",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "``@sam`` and `a @lee c`",
      "names": ["lee"]
    },
    {
      "body": "`unclosed @sam",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Code `x`@sam",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "`multi\nline @sam`",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "**@sam** and *@kim* and _@lee_",
      "names": ["sam", "kim", "lee"]
    },
    {
      "body": "[@sam](https://example.com) and [@kim](ftp://example.com)",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "See https://example.com/@sam then @kim",
      "names": ["kim"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Line one\r\n\r\n@sam",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "A byte-order mark (U+FEFF, a paste can carry one) is a space: hi\ufeff@sam",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "\ufeff@sam at the start",
      "names": ["sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "A next-line mark is not a space: a\u0085@sam",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "**\ufeff@sam** is not bold, @sam still is a mention",
      "names": ["sam", "sam"]
    },
    {
      "body": "An astral letter joins the name: @sam\ud840\udc00 and @\ud840\udc00kim",
      "names": ["sam\ud840\udc00", "\ud840\udc00kim"]
    },
    {
      "body": "An astral digit too: @lee\ud835\udfce, but not an emoji: @kim\ud83d\ude00",
      "names": ["lee\ud835\udfce", "kim"]
    },
    {
      "body": "Not after an astral letter: \ud840\udc00@sam",
      "names": []
    },
    {
      "body": "_@sam_\ud840\udc00 is no italic (a letter follows), so no mention",
      "names": []
    }
  ]
}
